        "original_id": "85f25945-b3a2-589a-8c91-39c3d5388a98",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rose Byrne, Nicholas Stoller, Jonah Hill, Russell Brand, Judd Apatow, Ben Lee\n- Works: Get Him to the Greek, Forgetting Sarah Marshall, The Rage in Placid Lake, Troy, 28 Weeks Later, Knowing, Insidious, Bridesmaids, Neighbors, Spy\n- Roles: actress, director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Rose Byrne was born on 24 July 1979 and is an Australian actress.\n- The Rage in Placid Lake is a 2003 Australian film starring Ben Lee and Rose Byrne.\n- Get Him to the Greek was released on June 4, 2010.\n- Get Him to the Greek is a spin-off sequel to Nicholas Stoller's 2008 film Forgetting Sarah Marshall.\n- Get Him to the Greek reunited director Nicholas Stoller with stars Jonah Hill and Russell Brand and producer Judd Apatow.\n- Rose Byrne starred in the films Troy, 28 Weeks Later, Knowing, Insidious, Get Him to the Greek, Bridesmaids, Neighbors, and Spy.",
